  "description": "The native payload for Agora's video enhancement extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_iOS 4.7.0 archive and packaged for .NET for iOS. The image-quality filters: low-light enhancement, video denoising, colour enhancement and the face-beautification options. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.iOS, not Net.Agora.Voice.iOS, which lacks a framework this one links — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraRtcEngineKit.SetLowlightEnhanceOptions / SetVideoDenoiserOptions / SetColorEnhanceOptions / SetBeautyEffectOptions in the RTC binding.",
